<div class="ledger-section"><div class="faction-row"><span class="party party-pis"><b>PiS</b></span><span>[+ status_rival_pis_party_org_band +] organisation · [+ status_rival_pis_party_cohesion_band +] · [+ status_rival_pis_party_sejm +] Sejm · [+ status_rival_pis_party_senate +] Senate</span></div>
